Subject: [PATCH 03/12] v1.6.1 [H]: persona merge/apply fixes, shipped persona
 brief, remap on disk, nested reference_docs WARN

H1 correct backfills the cited doc's tier. H2 correct replaces every prose
field it supplies and flags the rest (needs_text_review). H3 confirm beside a
grounded correct is a dissent, not a conflict. H4 adds citing the same passage
cluster to one. H5 references/persona_brief.md is the persona prompt
(persona_orchestration.persona_prompt), staged by run_feature_h. H6 the
terminal renumber is applied to quality/bugs_manifest.json and
citation_semantic_check.json, and recorded in quality/req_id_remap.json. H7 the
disclosure names the reviewers that ran and the undo's bug-record limit. I1
reference_docs_ingest warns on nested files it skips.
